{"1.15.2":{"1.0.13":"- Rabbits summoned by the Conjurer are now on his team (if he has one)\n- Adjusted the Conjurer's texture. It re-shades his hat to make more sense light wise."},"1.16.1":{"1.0.8":"- Added new colored spellcasting particles to the Conjurer.\n- Increased the amount of attempts the code will make to teleport the player when the Conjurer uses his displacement spell."},"1.16.2":{"1.0.9":"- Updated to 1.16.2"},"1.16.4":{"1.0.13":"- A quick port to 1.16.4 using the Structure Gel alpha. A small content update might be in the works for the next one!"},"1.17.1":{"1.1.0":"- Updated to 1.17.1\n- The Conjurer's hat now resists magic damage by 30%, alongside preventing bad omen.\n- Added new playing card item. Able to be thrown for little damage, but only stack up to 52.\n- Added throwable bouncy balls. These do decent damage, and bounce on surfaces. They are always dropped when popped.\n- Added new music disc, \"Delve Deeper\" by Jesterguy. This is a rare drop from the Conjurer."},"1.18.1":{"1.1.1":"- Updated to 1.18.1\n- Tweaked the Conjurer's targeting conditions"},"1.18.2":{"1.1.1":"- Updated to 1.18.2"},"1.19.2":{"1.1.2":"- Updated to 1.19.2\n- Storage chests in the Conjurer's dressing room have loot","1.1.3":"- Hotfix to fix which biome the structure generates in","1.1.4":"- Biome config values properly work","1.1.5":"- Updated minimum Forge to 43.1.47, using new spawn placement registry system\n- Updated minimum Structure Gel to 2.7.1\n- Fixed a lockup that could happen when locating a theater"},"1.19.3":{"1.1.5":"- Initial 1.19.3 port"},"1.19.4":{"1.1.6":"- Updated to 1.19.4\n- The Conjurer's magic balls actually do magic damage now"},"homepage":"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-conjurer","promos":{"1.15.2-latest":"1.0.13","1.15.2-recommended":"1.0.13","1.16.1-latest":"1.0.8","1.16.1-recommended":"1.0.8","1.16.2-latest":"1.0.9","1.16.2-recommended":"1.0.9","1.16.4-latest":"1.0.13","1.16.4-recommended":"1.0.13","1.17.1-latest":"1.1.0","